# The workbench calls the API at /api on its own origin (Vite proxies it to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000 in development; set API_PROXY_TARGET to change that).
# VITE_API_URL overrides the base URL entirely; a different origin will not carry the
# session cookie. No secrets belong here: VITE_ variables are shipped to the browser.
# VITE_API_URL=/api
